af22d2ab79654554276c09bc0a55bb70e61b68c162a3c5c9c8fe6ba8","pageNumber":3,"text":[{"text":"Client Name","bbox":[66.3844,116.31287,135.73239,128.31287],"origin":[66.3844,125.58502],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":12.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Generic Client","bbox":[147.73239,116.56485,217.41737,127.56485],"origin":[147.73239,125.06433],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Scoring and Interpretation Information (cont.)","bbox":[34.3465,144.03752,336.92838,158.03752],"origin":[34.3465,154.85504],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":14.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"The fact that an event occurs does not mean that the patient experienced it as traumatic, so it is","bbox":[91.0394,163.29306,556.33942,174.29306],"origin":[91.0394,171.79254],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"recommended that clinicians explore the client's subjective experience of each incident. The","bbox":[91.0394,175.39304,538.22241,186.39304],"origin":[91.0394,183.89252],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"PTSD Checklist-5 (PCL-5) can be used to confirm the presence of other diagnostic criteria in","bbox":[91.0394,187.49301,540.98352,198.49301],"origin":[91.0394,195.99249],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"order to determine if a PTSD diagnosis is applicable.","bbox":[91.0394,199.59299,347.19632,210.59299],"origin":[91.0394,208.09247],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Most adults have been exposed to a potentially traumatic event (experienced, witnessed, or had","bbox":[91.0394,223.793,557.5495,234.793],"origin":[91.0394,232.29248],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"a close family member or friend experience a traumatic incident). For context in comparison to","bbox":[91.0394,235.89297,548.30945,246.89297],"origin":[91.0394,244.39246],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"typical experiences, only 39.5% of adults score 0, and 60.5% of adults have experienced at least","bbox":[91.0394,247.99295,560.61853,258.99295],"origin":[91.0394,256.49243],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"one potential traumatic experience (Morawej et al., 2024). The level of exposure is related to the","bbox":[91.0394,260.09293,558.14343,271.09293],"origin":[91.0394,268.59241],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"likelihood of experiencing PTSD symptoms, though it is possible that only one incident can lead","bbox":[91.0394,272.1929,554.46954,283.1929],"origin":[91.0394,280.69238],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"to PTSD.","bbox":[91.0394,284.29288,135.66638,295.29288],"origin":[91.0394,292.79236],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Three traumatic event-type clusters were identified (Contractor et al., 2020):","bbox":[91.0394,308.49289,459.68237,319.49289],"origin":[91.0394,316.99237],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"-Accidental/Injury Traumas - items: 1, 2, 3, 4, 12","bbox":[91.0394,320.59286,325.18546,331.59286],"origin":[91.0394,329.09235],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"-Victimization Traumas - items: 6, 8, 9","bbox":[91.0394,332.69287,275.64136,343.69287],"origin":[91.0394,341.19235],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"-Predominant Death Threat Traumas: - 5, 7, 10, 11, 13-16","bbox":[91.0394,344.79288,372.89246,355.79288],"origin":[91.0394,353.29236],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Powered by TCPDF (www.tcpdf.org)","bbox":[5.9999,839.89166,22.1699,840.89166],"origin":[5.9999,840.66437],"font":"Helvetica","size":1.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Page 3 of 3","bbox":[510.2359,809.92664,561.38599,819.92664],"origin":[510.2359,817.65344],"font":"Helvetica","size":10.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]}],"tables":[],"chartObservations":[]}],"rasterRegions":[],"rasterTranscriptions":[],"removedFalseChartDetections":[]}
